{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25464","headline":"春暮思平泉杂咏二十首 山桂 · 李德裕","name":"春暮思平泉杂咏二十首 山桂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾爱山中树，繁英满目鲜。\n临风飘碎锦，映日乱非烟。\n影入春潭底，香凝月榭前。\n岂知幽独客，赖此当朱弦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25464.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25464","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}